Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: sunxi: add V831/V833 compatibles and CCU indices

CCU, MMC, pinctrl, SPI and watchdog compatibles plus the clock/reset index
headers for the sun8i-v833 CCU (V831 is the same die without the extra pins).

---
